<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Section 4: The Foolproof Rebuild Plan | Astro Rebuild Plan</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #000000; }
        .dark body { background-color: #000000; color: #FFFFFF; }
        .prose { color: inherit; max-width: 80ch; }
        .prose h1, .prose h2, .prose h3, .prose h4, .prose strong { color: inherit; }
        .prose p, .prose li { color: inherit; opacity: 0.9; @apply text-lg leading-relaxed; }
        .prose a { color: #2563EB; } .dark .prose a { color: #60A5FA; }
        .prose code:not(.code-block code) { @apply rounded-md px-1.5 py-1 text-base; background-color: #F3F4F6; color: #111827; } .dark .prose code:not(.code-block code) { background-color: #1F2937; color: #F9FAFB; }
        .code-block { background-color: #1F2937; color: #F9FAFB; @apply rounded-lg my-2 p-4 text-sm; }
        .header-text { color: #000000; } .dark .header-text { color: #FFFFFF; }
        .subheader-text { color: #4A5568; } .dark .subheader-text { color: #A0AEC0; }
        .accent-text { color: #2563EB; } .dark .accent-text { color: #60A5FA; }
        .footer { border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0; } .dark .footer { border-top: 1px solid #374151; }
        .phase-complete-box { background-color: #F0FFF4; border-left: 4px solid #22C55E; @apply p-4 my-6; }
        .dark .phase-complete-box { background-color: #162A22; }
        .phase-progress-box { background-color: #FEFCE8; border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; @apply p-4 my-6; }
        .dark .phase-progress-box { background-color: #2c240f; }
        .table { border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; } .dark .table { border: 1px solid #374151; }
        .table th, .table td { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0; } .dark .table th, .dark .table td { border-bottom: 1px solid #374151; }
        .status-completed { @apply inline-flex items-center px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-800; }
        .dark .status-completed { @apply bg-green-900 text-green-200; }
        .status-progress { @apply inline-flex items-center px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-full bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800; }
        .dark .status-progress { @apply bg-yellow-900 text-yellow-200; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-10 sm:py-16">
        <header class="mb-12">
            <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center accent-text hover:underline mb-6 font-semibold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Back to Main Index
            </a>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold accent-text tracking-wider uppercase">Section 4</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold header-text leading-tight mt-1">The Foolproof Rebuild Plan</h1>
            <h2 class="text-xl subheader-text mt-3">A Step-by-Step Guide</h2>
        </header>
        <main class="prose mx-auto">
            <article>
                <div class="phase-complete-box">
                    <h3 class="mt-0">Phase 1: Foundational Project Setup</h3>
                    <p><strong>Status: Completed.</strong> You have successfully initialized the project, configured it for deployment, created the GitHub repository, and pushed your local code. The foundation is now solid.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                    <table class="min-w-full table rounded-lg text-left text-base">
                        <thead class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800">
                           <tr>
                                <th class="font-semibold">Step</th>
                                <th class="font-semibold">Action</th>
                                <th class="font-semibold">Status</th>
                                <th class="font-semibold">Details</th>
                           </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                           <tr>
                                <td>1-5</td>
                                <td>Complete Foundational Setup</td>
                                <td><span class="status-completed">Completed</span></td>
                                <td><a href="#" class="accent-text font-semibold hover:underline">View Code</a></td>
                           </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <hr class="my-12">

                <div class="phase-progress-box">
                    <h3 class="mt-0">Phase 2: Building the Static Structure</h3>
                    <p><strong>Status: In Progress.</strong> You have the dev server running. The next step is to replace the starter content with the rebuild guide content.</p>
                </div>
                <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-4">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Create the Main Index Page:</strong>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 pl-4">
                           <li>Open `src/pages/index.astro`.</li>
                           <li>Delete all the existing content inside this file.</li>
                           <li>Copy the **entire HTML code** from our "Main Index" guide page and paste it into `src/pages/index.astro`.</li>
                           <li>Your dev server should auto-reload to show the new index page.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                     <li>
                        <strong>Create the Section Pages:</strong>
                         <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 pl-4">
                           <li>In the `src/pages/` directory, create a new file named `section-1.astro`.</li>
                           <li>Copy the **entire HTML code** from our "Section 1" guide page and paste it into `section-1.astro`.</li>
                           <li>Repeat this process for all other sections, creating `section-2.astro`, `section-3.astro`, and so on. Also create `sources.astro` for the sources page.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Link the Pages Together:</strong>
                         <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 pl-4">
                            <li>Open the new `src/pages/index.astro`.</li>
                            <li>Find the `<a>` tags for each section card. Change the `href="#"` to the correct path, e.g., `href="/google-gemini-codes/section-1.astro"`.</li>
                            <li>In each section page (e.g., `section-1.astro`), find the "Back to Main Index" link and change its `href="#"` to `href="/google-gemini-codes/"`.</li>
                         </ul>
                    </li>
                </ol>
                <p>After these steps, you will have a multi-page website where the content is our rebuild guide. This completes the static structure of your first project.</p>


                <h3>4.3 Phase 3: Integrating Animations Safely</h3>
                <p>Once your static structure is complete, you can move to this phase. It directly addresses the original point of failure by choosing the right animation strategy for the job.</p>
                 <div class="code-block">
<pre><code>&lt;!-- src/components/AnimatedHeader.astro --&gt;
&lt;h1 id="animated-heading" class="opacity-0"&gt;Hello, Animated World!&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;script&gt;
  import { gsap } from "gsap";
  gsap.to("#animated-heading", { opacity: 1, y: -20, duration: 1 });
&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
                </div>
                
                <h3>4.4 Phase 4: Deployment via GitHub Actions</h3>
                <p>When you are ready to publish your site, you will use this phase. In your GitHub repository settings, go to `Settings > Pages` and set the "Source" to "GitHub Actions." Then, create the `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` file with the standard Astro workflow.</p>
                <div class="code-block">
<pre><code># .github/workflows/deploy.yml
name: Deploy to GitHub Pages
on:
  push:
    branches: ["main"]
permissions:
  contents: read
  pages: write
  id-token: write
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Setup Node
        uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: "20"
      - name: Install dependencies
        run: npm ci
      - name: Build with Astro
        run: npm run build
      - name: Upload artifact
        uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3
        with:
          path: ./dist
  deploy:
    environment:
      name: github-pages
      url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    needs: build
    steps:
      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages
        id: deployment
        uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4
</code></pre>
                </div>

            </article>
        </main>
        <footer class="text-center py-8 mt-12 footer">
            <p class="text-sm subheader-text">Astro Rebuild Guide | Section 4</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
